[[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2892147\">7030B20</a>\n                                           (front or rear)</p><p>1. Disconnect the electric  motor electrical connection.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Front sun roof motor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890897\">N36</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Rear sun roof motor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890899\">N37</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the bolts securing the lower frame.</p><p>3. Lower lower frame (3a) by working from the rear and simultaneously\nraise upper frame (3b) and remove.</p>"],[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the lower frame\nand upper frame are undamaged.</p><p>Fit the upper frame and the lower frame\nin their seats, then secure with bolts.</p><p>Check the motor electrical connection.</p><p><a href=\"#/2892147\">7030B20</a>\n                                           (front or\nrear)</p>"]]